This patch has been intentionally quarantined.

It previously proposed expanding Z.ai model allowlists and adding a live
model-probing diagnostic endpoint. That approach is rejected for release
stabilization because Z.ai model names must not be guessed, provider HTTP 400
model/configuration failures must be classified and quarantined, and browser/API
responses must not expose raw provider response bodies or model probing details.

Do not apply this patch.
